{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oVbAXLGAz51792983319.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子在元朗壆圍路貨倉被狗咬傷，送博愛醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Nhl1b1lt8V1792983316.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>事發在早上約八時，一名26歲男子報案指，在壆圍路被三隻狗追，最後被其中一隻咬傷左腳，受輕傷送院治理。據了解，傷者當時經過「祥興物流」貨倉，有三隻狗由貨倉衝出，其中一隻約6歲的雌性唐狗將他咬傷。漁護署之後將唐狗帶走檢查。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1030_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RCC7omEgJa1792983312.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>元朗壆圍南路、錦壆路上月懷疑發生狗咬死人事件，漁護署連續多天到場，捕捉無人看管的狗隻，並到貨倉派單張，提醒要妥善管束好狗隻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:41:49.126793+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:38:10.980983+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:27.074999+00:00","content_hash":"e88064b4a59383eca0674b8b70ab322612c407a1e773b5455d3dee8058cf0a98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:41:49.126793+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}